        "source": "// A Publisher can be used to publish the value to an etcd cluster on the given key.\ntype Publisher struct {\n\tendpoints  []string\n\tuser       string\n\tpass       string\n\tkey        string\n\tfullKey    string\n\tid         int64\n\tvalue      string\n\tlease      clientv3.LeaseID\n\tquit       *syncx.DoneChan\n\tpauseChan  chan lang.PlaceholderType\n\tresumeChan chan lang.PlaceholderType\n}"
